Aura Engine is a Windows port of Aura:

  Aura - https://github.com/antwny/aura
  Copyright (C) antwny and contributors
  Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

The original Aura source was used as the reference for this port. The
Windows implementation, WorkerW hosting, mpv integration, egui interface
and CLI are new code, while some modules (notably the MotionBGS catalog
parser and the palette extraction algorithm) are adapted from the
original GPL-3.0-or-later code.

